course: dictionary
lesson: 12164
title: Composed: three meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. Composed is a good example. Look at the words around it to find which meaning fits. «Water is composed of hydrogen and oxygen.» Here composed means made of or formed from certain parts.
explain: «Mia composed a song for the school concert.» Here composed means wrote or created. The clue is the word song: you can write a song, but a song cannot be made of hydrogen. Always ask: what word would fit here? Then try your meaning in the sentence and see if it still makes sense.
explain: «When the fire alarm rang, Mrs Okafor stayed calm and composed.» Here composed is an adjective that describes a person. It means calm and in control of your feelings. The clue is calm, a word with a similar meaning, so you can check your answer against it.
fact: Composed is the past form of the verb compose: compose, composes, composed, composing.
fact: «Composed of» means made of or formed from certain parts, as in «a number composed of tens and ones».
fact: «Composed» can mean wrote or created music, a poem or a letter.
fact: As an adjective, «composed» means calm and in control of your feelings.
fact: Check the clues: if the sentence talks about parts, music, writing or feelings, that tells you which meaning to choose.
exercise: «Water is composed of hydrogen and oxygen.» What does composed mean here? | Spilled all over the floor | *Made of, or formed from, certain parts | Wrote a song about water | Calm and in control
exercise: «Mia composed a song for the school concert.» What does composed mean here? | *Wrote or created | Hidden under a table | Calm and quiet | Made of many small parts
exercise: «Even in the storm, the captain stayed calm and composed.» What does composed mean here? | Very loud and noisy | Lost and afraid | Wet through from the rain | *Calm and in control of his feelings
test: Ruby says «composed» means worried. What does it really mean as an adjective? | Shouting loudly | Worried and anxious | Very tired after a run | *Calm and in control of your feelings
test: «The poem was composed in the park.» What does composed mean here? | *Wrote or created | Calm | Made of parts | Lost
exam: Read «Dev composed a letter to his gran, calm and composed as ever.» What does the first composed mean? | Made of parts | *Wrote or created | Hidden | Calm
